id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state; tests use the testkit's thread-local register_scripts, and scripts::registered_scripts() reads that override first
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
test.registration: each cards cross test calls jackioh_cards::register_all() before scenario() (a local setup fn)
test.live_objects: owned CardInstance copies; re-read with s.card()/find_instance, write with find_instance_mut on s.state_mut()
test.literals: scenario options, play options and effect args as json!(TS literal) / json_as(json!); event and view equality via serde_json::to_value
test.default_params: a TS default parameter is passed explicitly (Default::default() for an options object)
